PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/active?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sin el parámetro obligatorio → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Mascotas de un dueño → 200 (404 si el dueño no existe)
