### REST · /api/drugs
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar medicamentos → 200 [DrugResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar solo medicamentos con stock → 200 [DrugResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs?available=true
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de medicamento → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear medicamento → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Vitamina B12 Inyectable",
  "purchasePrice": 5000.00,
  "salePrice": 9500.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 50
}

### Crear duplicado (mismo nombre) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Vitamina B12 Inyectable",
  "purchasePrice": 5000.00,
  "salePrice": 9500.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 10
}

### Crear inválido → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "purchasePrice": -1,
  "salePrice": null,
  "unitsAvailable": -5
}

### Importar medicamentos desde Excel → 200 DrugImportSummaryResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/import
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="medicamentos.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./medicamentos.xlsx
--WebAppBoundary--

### Actualizar (unitsSold en el body se ignora) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Amoxicilina 250mg",
  "purchasePrice": 8500.00,
  "salePrice": 16000.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 190,
  "unitsSold": 999
}

### Eliminar el medicamento creado arriba (sin tratamientos) → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/{{createdDrugId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/treatments
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar tratamientos → 200 [TreatmentResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de tratamiento → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Ingreso: la mascota 1 está estable, así que va sin evolución → 201 + Location
# @name ingreso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Seguimiento con medicamentos (atómico): ya hay diagnóstico, la evolución es obligatoria → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "evolution": "IMPROVING",
  "notes": "Menos inflamación que en la consulta anterior.",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 },
    { "drugId": 11, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Seguimiento sin evolución (la mascota 1 ya está en tratamiento) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Evolución STABLE con un diagnóstico distinto al actual → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Gastroenteritis",
  "evolution": "STABLE",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Evolución RECOVERED solo la usa el alta, no un tratamiento → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "evolution": "RECOVERED",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Crear sin medicamentos (drugs vacío) → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "evolution": "IMPROVING",
  "drugs": []
}

### Crear con fecha futura → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "weight": 12.4,
  "diagnosis": "Otitis externa",
  "evolution": "IMPROVING",
  "date": "2030-01-01T10:00:00",
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Medicamentos del tratamiento → 200 (404 si el tratamiento no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Administrar medicamento → 201 (sin Location)
# Solo se administran medicamentos en tratamientos propios: se usa el ingreso registrado arriba por el
# veterinario del token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/{{ingreso.response.body.id}}/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "drugId": 5,
  "units": 2
}

### Administrar duplicado → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/{{ingreso.response.body.id}}/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "drugId": 5,
  "units": 1
}

### Historial de una mascota → 200 (404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dar de alta (queda estable; evolution RECOVERED y sin medicamentos) → 200 TreatmentResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/discharge?veterinarianId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dar de alta otra vez (la mascota ya está estable) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/discharge?veterinarianId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Alta sin veterinarianId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/discharge
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Foto de una mascota servida por el API → 200 imagen (404 si no hay o no se pudo descargar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}

### Mascotas atendidas por un veterinario → 200 (404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/auth
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# La petición de login lleva nombre (@name) para reutilizar su token en las siguientes
# con {{login.response.body.token}} (sintaxis de REST Client / cliente HTTP de JetBrains).

### Login de dueño → 200 AuthResponse (token, expiresIn 7200, role OWNER)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Perfil del usuario autenticado con el token del login anterior → 200 AuthProfileResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Perfil sin token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Perfil con un token inválido → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido
Accept: application/json

### Login con password mala → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "mala"
}

### Login con email desconocido → 401 (mismo mensaje, sin enumerar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

