### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### Permisos (matriz por rol y recursos propios)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Sin token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Accept: application/json

### Dueño consultando su propio perfil → 200 OwnerResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dueño consultando el perfil de otro dueño → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Dueño listando todos los dueños (su rol no tiene acceso) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Administrador registrando una mascota (solo el veterinario puede) → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin permiso",
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "Criollo",
  "age": 2,
  "weight": 10.5,
  "ownerId": 1
}

### Veterinario consultando el perfil de otro veterinario → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### Veterinario dando de alta a nombre de otro veterinario → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/discharge?veterinarianId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVet.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json
